      "message": "serdar, this is to get the test failure pass that is caused by the snapshot\nsupport of vkqueueflushcommandsgoogle. there is lots of dependecy  of flushcommandgoogle on buffer, and during the test, the buffer was first destroyed; but then flushcommandgoogle still refers to it and caused crash of the test.\n\nso this cl will just return nullhandle if the buffer is destroied.\n\nideally, the buffer should not have been destroyed but it seems the dependency\nis getting very hard to detect based on current framework.",
